sts Barre within Fitness in the Parks and describes those classes as safe and free for all ages and abilities.","source_url":"https://epl.providenceri.gov/parks-playgrounds/","source_title":"Parks + Playground Programs — Eat, Play, Learn PVD","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The city lists Barre at the Roger Williams Park Gateway Center; a waiver is required before a first program activity.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"all-ages-yoga-fitness-in-the-parks","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"All Ages Yoga","title":"Stretch at All Ages Yoga","subtitle":"Roger Williams Park Gateway Center","notes":"Bring a towel or mat if you have one and join the listed yoga session; the class is designed for all ages and abilities through the city program.","short_summary":"A no-cost group yoga session in a named Roger Williams Park facility.","evidence_claim":"Providence lists All Ages Yoga at the Roger Williams Park Gateway Center through its safe, free Fitness in the Parks classes.","source_url":"https://epl.providenceri.gov/parks-playgrounds/","source_title":"Parks + Playground Programs — Eat, Play, Learn PVD","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The listed session is Wednesdays, 10–11 a.m.; a participant waiver is required before the first Fitness in the Parks activity.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"pep-in-your-step-fitness-in-the-parks","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Pep in Your Step","title":"Get moving with Pep in Your Step","subtitle":"Roger Williams Park Gateway Center","notes":"Use the listed Thursday session as a planned movement break with classmates; complete the city waiver before joining your first park fitness class.","short_summary":"A free, city-run group fitness activity at the Gateway Center.","evidence_claim":"Providence lists Pep in Your Step at the Roger Williams Park Gateway Center as part of its safe, free Fitness in the Parks program.","source_url":"https://epl.providenceri.gov/parks-playgrounds/","source_title":"Parks + Playground Programs — Eat, Play, Learn PVD","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The listed session is Thursdays, 5–6 p.m.; check the city page for changes and complete the required waiver before first participation.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
